e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T13:43:36.2639309Z ok - first observation of a non-zero count is a POSSIBLY UNREPAIRED request (no longer a silent baseline)
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T13:43:36.2640806Z ok - an increase attributes the delta
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T13:43:36.2641727Z ok - unchanged attributes nothing
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T13:43:36.2642643Z ok - a counter that went DOWN is a reset: the new count is all new drops
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T13:43:36.2643487Z ok - a reset to zero (fresh master, no drops yet) attributes nothing
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T13:43:36.2644230Z ok - a destination first seen on an INITIALIZED ledger counts fully
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T13:43:36.2645009Z ok - counters are keyed per master: another master's first sighting also counts
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T13:43:36.2645914Z ok - a request is recorded once per destination
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T13:43:36.2646562Z ok - more drops on the same destination extend the entry, not duplicate it
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T13:43:36.2647247Z ok - a destination matching a Slave resolves to its key
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T13:43:36.2647858Z ok - an unmatched destination stays requested and unresolved
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T13:43:36.2648489Z ok - a destination that is now a MASTER is voided, not demoted
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T13:43:36.2649122Z ok - resolution accepts the bare host as well as host:port
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T13:43:36.2649773Z ok - a gated request is HELD with its reason and produces no action
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T13:43:36.2650513Z ok - a held request is not excluded from assignment (only a demoted one is)
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T13:43:36.2651310Z ok - when the gate opens the held request becomes an action and the hold clears
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T13:43:36.2651978Z ok - a demoted node is held out of assignment
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T13:43:36.2652481Z ok - plan does not act twice on a demoted entry
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T13:43:36.2653358Z ok - the mode on and following/initial_sync/disconnected/error own; needs_rebuild, idle, off and unreadable do not
